    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent type foundry based in Paris (61 rue de Lancry), the type arm of graphic design studio Violaine & Jeremy, founded by Jeremy Schneider and Violaine Orsoni (vj-type.com/about, violaineetjeremy.fr). 14 typefaces for sale direct (Cako, Canopee, Category, Dahlia, Dida, Eros, Jager, Kobe, Love, Nord, Pilote, Sud, Traviata, Voyage); own about/terms copy describes it as a small structure. Site footer reads copyright 2026, so still active as of this pass. Capabilities kept to Type design only here since this entry is the foundry itself; the parent studio's broader graphic design, branding, illustration and editorial work is a separate practice not captured on this entry.",
